# Stack repair priority

If `.cursor/STACK_REPAIR_DUE` exists in this project, your **first priority** is:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/stack-repair/SKILL.md` and execute the full checklist.
2. Keep working (fix code, rerun stack scripts) until `python scripts/stack_repair_check.py` succeeds.
3. Delete `.cursor/STACK_REPAIR_DUE` when finished and ensure `state/stack_repair.json` has `"status": "done"`.

Do not stop after a single failed ensure — loop diagnose/fix/verify until the stack is online.
